A potential duplicate exists only when BOTH are true:
1. Same finding type (CWE / finding class)
2. Same sink: Class.method if present on both sides; otherwise the same file AND the same row/line

Do NOT mark duplicates for: shared Unit, similar title, same severity, or same file with a different method.

Inputs:
- @<this-scan-findings>
- @<prior-scan-findings>   (stack rounds 1–3 if needed)
