Jira: only attach a Key when Summary or Description mentions this finding id, this file, or this Class.method. Do not invent keys. Do not build a tracker.

Output only:

1. Table: this_id | type | sink_method | sink_row | prior_scan | prior_id | match | jira_keys
2. Count of current findings that hit at least one prior sink
